{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "03156",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "NURSE",
      "start_seconds": 0.51,
      "end_seconds": 7.7,
      "duration_seconds": 7.19,
      "text": "Okay, doctor, we're all set in here. I'll give you the numbers when you want them."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 9.15,
      "end_seconds": 13.12,
      "duration_seconds": 3.97,
      "text": "Okay, thanks. Hi, how can I help today?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CAREGIVER",
      "start_seconds": 13.82,
      "end_seconds": 17.99,
      "duration_seconds": 4.17,
      "text": "Thank you for fitting us in, doctor."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 19.21,
      "end_seconds": 21.33,
      "duration_seconds": 2.12,
      "text": "It's being sick, mostly."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 23.21,
      "end_seconds": 25.28,
      "duration_seconds": 2.07,
      "text": "Tell me your medicines, please."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 26.98,
      "end_seconds": 41.87,
      "duration_seconds": 14.89,
      "text": "I mean, uh, I take hydrocortisone cream, when needed for the eczema. I'm on something called losa... losartan, 50 milligrams, maybe, once a day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 43.61,
      "end_seconds": 49.05,
      "duration_seconds": 5.44,
      "text": "Okay, have you got the box or the prescription on you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 50.31,
      "end_seconds": 61.28,
      "duration_seconds": 10.97,
      "text": "Yeah, not with me. I'll bring it next time. I take sumatriptan, 50 milligrams, when needed for my migraines."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 63.15,
      "end_seconds": 71.96,
      "duration_seconds": 8.81,
      "text": "It's a... um, I can't remember what it's called. It's a little pink tablet."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 72.61,
      "end_seconds": 75.27,
      "duration_seconds": 2.66,
      "text": "Do you remember what it's for?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 75.87,
      "end_seconds": 85.88,
      "duration_seconds": 10.01,
      "text": "For the prostate, I believe. My husband sets them out for me, I just take what I'm given."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 86.8,
      "end_seconds": 90.2,
      "duration_seconds": 3.4,
      "text": "How long has it been like this?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 91.71,
      "end_seconds": 95.47,
      "duration_seconds": 3.76,
      "text": "It's been two months, I'm fairly sure."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 97.41,
      "end_seconds": 100.3,
      "duration_seconds": 2.89,
      "text": "How much trouble does it give you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 101.69,
      "end_seconds": 103.42,
      "duration_seconds": 1.73,
      "text": "It's mild, honestly."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 104.06,
      "end_seconds": 107.62,
      "duration_seconds": 3.56,
      "text": "Alright, is it constant or in episodes?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 109.64,
      "end_seconds": 113.82,
      "duration_seconds": 4.18,
      "text": "I'd say a couple of times a week."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 114.65,
      "end_seconds": 121.53,
      "duration_seconds": 6.88,
      "text": "And the other thing I wanted to mention is that I can't really—"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CAREGIVER",
      "start_seconds": 121.63,
      "end_seconds": 128.65,
      "duration_seconds": 7.02,
      "text": "Tell the doctor about the other thing, uh, that's what worries me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 129.41,
      "end_seconds": 134.06,
      "duration_seconds": 4.65,
      "text": "I was getting to that! And double vision, too."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 135.79,
      "end_seconds": 138.39,
      "duration_seconds": 2.6,
      "text": "How much does it limit you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 139.43,
      "end_seconds": 141.16,
      "duration_seconds": 1.73,
      "text": "Severe, I'd say."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 141.64,
      "end_seconds": 142.56,
      "duration_seconds": 0.92,
      "text": "I follow."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 143.76,
      "end_seconds": 149.21,
      "duration_seconds": 5.45,
      "text": "I've also had a severe headache for days, since yesterday."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 154.57,
      "end_seconds": 157.25,
      "duration_seconds": 2.68,
      "text": "How much does it limit you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 162.31,
      "end_seconds": 163.97,
      "duration_seconds": 1.66,
      "text": "Mild, I'd say."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 164.85,
      "end_seconds": 169.74,
      "duration_seconds": 4.89,
      "text": "Have you had being sick before, or is this the first time?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 171.68,
      "end_seconds": 179.74,
      "duration_seconds": 8.06,
      "text": "Yes, something like this happened last year, and it went away on its own."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_5",
      "role": "UNKNOWN",
      "start_seconds": 181.14,
      "end_seconds": 184.09,
      "duration_seconds": 2.95,
      "text": "Mm, that's what happened, yes."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 189.61,
      "end_seconds": 194.43,
      "duration_seconds": 4.82,
      "text": "And what about weakness on one side, fever or head injury?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 195.41,
      "end_seconds": 209.01,
      "duration_seconds": 13.6,
      "text": "No, no weakness on one side, no fever, no head injury. I did have drowsiness at one point, but that went away on its own."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 210.18,
      "end_seconds": 212.54,
      "duration_seconds": 2.36,
      "text": "Anything unusual with passing urine?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 218.25,
      "end_seconds": 221.41,
      "duration_seconds": 3.16,
      "text": "Hmm, no, that's all fine."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 222.93,
      "end_seconds": 225.44,
      "duration_seconds": 2.51,
      "text": "Right, is your mobility otherwise okay?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 231.14,
      "end_seconds": 232.61,
      "duration_seconds": 1.47,
      "text": "Nothing else aches."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 233.34,
      "end_seconds": 238.88,
      "duration_seconds": 5.54,
      "text": "Alright, what conditions have you been treated for in the past?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 240.92,
      "end_seconds": 251.15,
      "duration_seconds": 10.23,
      "text": "Yes, eczema. I told myself I'd wait and see, and here I am. High blood pressure, for nearly five years."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 255.64,
      "end_seconds": 256.48,
      "duration_seconds": 0.84,
      "text": "Anything else?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 258.23,
      "end_seconds": 267.15,
      "duration_seconds": 8.92,
      "text": "Yes, migraines. I have an enlarged prostate. My neighbour said I should get it looked at."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 268.54,
      "end_seconds": 274.37,
      "duration_seconds": 5.83,
      "text": "Okay, I can see migraines and an enlarged prostate in your file as well."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 292.03,
      "end_seconds": 295.38,
      "duration_seconds": 3.35,
      "text": "Okay, have you had any surgical procedures?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 300.22,
      "end_seconds": 303.82,
      "duration_seconds": 3.6,
      "text": "Just a bunion operation, six years ago."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 304.43,
      "end_seconds": 305.69,
      "duration_seconds": 1.26,
      "text": "And your job?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 306.67,
      "end_seconds": 310.19,
      "duration_seconds": 3.52,
      "text": "I work in accounts at a hospital."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 311.67,
      "end_seconds": 315.59,
      "duration_seconds": 3.92,
      "text": "Right, has anyone in your family had anything serious?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 317.2,
      "end_seconds": 320.81,
      "duration_seconds": 3.61,
      "text": "So, my uncle has high cholesterol."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0047",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "NURSE",
      "start_seconds": 336.04,
      "end_seconds": 344.01,
      "duration_seconds": 7.97,
      "text": "Doctor, I've got the readings for you. Heart rate 83, oxygen saturation is 97 percent, pressure 170 over 103."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0048",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 344.92,
      "end_seconds": 345.62,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Thanks."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0049",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 346.89,
      "end_seconds": 349.23,
      "duration_seconds": 2.34,
      "text": "May I examine you now?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0050",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 350.92,
      "end_seconds": 352.36,
      "duration_seconds": 1.44,
      "text": "Breathe out slowly."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0051",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 360.34,
      "end_seconds": 364.7,
      "duration_seconds": 4.36,
      "text": "The optic discs look swollen and you are drowsy."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0052",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 365.75,
      "end_seconds": 367.44,
      "duration_seconds": 1.69,
      "text": "Fine by me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0053",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 373.19,
      "end_seconds": 385.68,
      "duration_seconds": 12.49,
      "text": "So, please sit back down. Having listened and examined, this is probably possible cerebral venous thrombosis. I'd also keep raised pressure in the head in mind."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0054",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 386.83,
      "end_seconds": 390.49,
      "duration_seconds": 3.66,
      "text": "I'm scared it's something bad. Is it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0055",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 395.63,
      "end_seconds": 413.77,
      "duration_seconds": 18.14,
      "text": "Nothing I've seen today points to an emergency. It looks like possible cerebral venous thrombosis, but I'd like to confirm. I'm going to order an MRI of the head, for papilloedema. I'm going to order an urgent CT venogram, for possible venous thrombosis."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0056",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 414.96,
      "end_seconds": 417.6,
      "duration_seconds": 2.64,
      "text": "How long will it take?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0057",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 419.62,
      "end_seconds": 435.02,
      "duration_seconds": 15.4,
      "text": "Stop the pill, you need an urgent scan and admission. I'll also refer you to the neurology team. And please bring the latest prescription or the medicine boxes to the next visit, so we can settle the dose."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0058",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 436.48,
      "end_seconds": 440.28,
      "duration_seconds": 3.8,
      "text": "Mm, okay, I'll look out for that."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0059",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 441.84,
      "end_seconds": 455.28,
      "duration_seconds": 13.44,
      "text": "Keep an eye out, and if the symptoms get worse, call us the same day or go to emergency. That's everything on my side. Anything you're unsure about?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0060",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 457.14,
      "end_seconds": 461.15,
      "duration_seconds": 4.01,
      "text": "Right, I'll do that. Thank you, doctor."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0061",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 461.74,
      "end_seconds": 462.94,
      "duration_seconds": 1.2,
      "text": "All the best."
    }
  ]
}